{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27326","headline":"赠元和十三年登第进士 · 陈标","name":"赠元和十三年登第进士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春官南院粉墙东，地色初分月色红。\n文字一千重马拥，喜欢三十二人同。\n眼看鱼变辞凡水，心逐鹦飞出瑞风。\n莫怪云泥从此别，总曾惆怅去年中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}